{end_of_part}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Baby, [Am]I'm d[F]ancing in the [C]dark, with [G]you between my [Am]arms
[F]Barefoot on the g[C]rass, [G]listening to our [Am]favourite song
When you s[F]aid you looked a [C]mess, I whispered [G]underneath my b[Am]reath
But you h[F]eard it, darling [C]you look [G]perfect ton[C]ight
{end_of_chorus}

[G][Am][G][F][G][C]

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
