She shares my [F]dreams, I hope that someday I'll share her [G]home
I found a l[C]ove, to carry [Am]more than just my secrets
To carry [F]love, to carry children of our [G]own
{end_of_verse}

{c: Pre-Chorus}
We are still kids, but we're [C]so in love, fighting a[Am]gainst all odds
I know we'll [F]be alright this [C]ti-[G]ime
